  <running_head>Castigatio Paral.</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1">mero Jesuita doce: Ea quæ necessariæ</l>
    <l n="2">consequentiæ vi ex scripturis derivan-</l>
    <l n="3">tur sunt pro traditionibus scriptis ha-</l>
    <l n="4">benda. Atqui Christus dicitur unus</l>
    <l n="5">Mediator, &amp; Emanuel Deus nobiscum:</l>
    <l n="6">ergo Deus &amp; homo in una persona.</l>
    <l n="7" para="true">Harscher Jes. <i>ubi est scriptum, an sint</i>
    </l>
    <l n="8">
      <i>duo sacramenta, an tria, an septem, an nul-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="9">
      <i>lum?</i> Augustine doce: Percussum est</l>
    <l n="10">Christi latus, ut Evangelium loquitur,</l>
    <l n="11">&amp; statim manavit sanguis &amp; aqua, quæ</l>
    <l n="12">sunt Ecclesiæ gemina sacramenta, <i>lib. 2.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="13">
      <i>de symb. ad catech. cap. 6.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="14" para="true">Harscher Jes. <i>Vbi est scriptum quod</i>
    </l>
    <l n="15">
      <i>Infantes sint baptizandi?</i> Catechisme</l>
    <l n="16">Romane doce: Credendum est noluisse</l>
    <l n="17">Christum Domini baptismi sacramen-</l>
    <l n="18">tum &amp; gratiam pueris denegari, de qui-</l>
    <l n="19">bus dicebat: finite puerulos &amp; nolite</l>
    <l n="20">eos prohibere ad me venire, talium</l>
    <l n="21">enim est regnum cœlorum, quos am-</l>
    <l n="22">plexabatur super quos manus impone-</l>
    <l n="23">bat, &amp; quos benedicebat. Bellarmine</l>
    <l n="24">doce:</l>
  </main_text>
